# rustbench.config: rust.config plus its own kernel release, 6.18.38-rust, so the Rust kernel lives next to the release
# kernel on one device: /boot/h713-kernel-rust.fit and /lib/modules/6.18.38-rust, never in the release's
# /lib/modules/6.18.38. For bench boots of modules with a Rust part (docs/kernel-rust.md, "A Rust kernel next to the
# release"). Developer fragment: KERNEL_CONFIG=rustbench build.sh kernel, never an image.
CONFIG_RUST=y
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-rust"
